 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음을 간단히 하시오.\n⑴ $20p^{4}q^{2}\\div 4p^{2}q^{5}$ ⑵ $28x^{3}y^{4}\\div\\left(-7xy^{3}\\right)$\n⑶ $\\left(-2ab^{2}\\right)^{2}\\div\\left(-a^{2}b\\right)^{3}$ ⑷ $\\left(\\frac{1}{3}xy^{2}\\right)^{2}\\div\\left(2x^{2}y\\right)^{2}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $\\frac{5p^{2}}{q^{3}}$ ⑵ $-4x^{2}y$ ⑶ $-\\frac{4b}{a^{4}}$ ⑷ $\\frac{y^{2}}{36x^{2}}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $20p^{4}q^{2}\\div 4p^{2}q^{5}=\\dfrac{20p^{4}q^{2}}{4p^{2}q^{5}}=\\dfrac{5p^{2}}{q^{3}}$이다.\n⑵ $28x^{3}y^{4}\\div\\left(-7xy^{3}\\right)=\\dfrac{28x^{3}y^{4}}{-7xy^{3}}=-4x^{2}y$이다.\n⑶ $\\left(-2ab^{2}\\right)^{2}=4a^{2}b^{4}$, $\\left(-a^{2}b\\right)^{3}=-a^{6}b^{3}$이므로 $\\dfrac{4a^{2}b^{4}}{-a^{6}b^{3}}=-\\dfrac{4b}{a^{4}}$이다.\n⑷ $\\left(\\frac{1}{3}xy^{2}\\right)^{2}=\\dfrac{1}{9}x^{2}y^{4}$, $\\left(2x^{2}y\\right)^{2}=4x^{4}y^{2}$이므로 $\\dfrac{1}{9}x^{2}y^{4}\\times\\dfrac{1}{4x^{4}y^{2}}=\\dfrac{y^{2}}{36x^{2}}$이다.\n따라서 답은 ⑴ $\\frac{5p^{2}}{q^{3}}$ ⑵ $-4x^{2}y$ ⑶ $-\\frac{4b}{a^{4}}$ ⑷ $\\frac{y^{2}}{36x^{2}}$이다.",
 "score": null,
